Thought: I have obtained several possible isomers for the molecular formula C18H20O2. To identify the correct structure, I should compare the NMR spectra of these isomers with the experimental NMR data. I will start by retrieving the proton NMR spectra for the sample to compare with the predicted spectra of these isomers.
Action: proton_nmr_spectra
Action Input: {}

Thought: Since the proton NMR prediction failed, I will try using the carbon NMR spectra to differentiate between the isomers. The carbon NMR can provide valuable information about the carbon skeleton and functional groups present in the compound.
